                                                "sense_id": "3447f1ed-1164-3df3-808f-f2e38dc96b5a",
                                                "text": "Away from the village, there was an enclosure containing several large animals of a kind I had not seen before—shaggy, long-necked, small-headed creatures who stood or lay at ease around their pen. Alpacas?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
